UID:X_8alJXMbkPj-_6UbSREG
SUMMARY:The Conjurer: An Intimate Magical Experience with Master Magician C
	urt Miller in League City
DTSTAMP:20260811T095928Z
DTSTART:20260814T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Conjurer: An Intimate Magical Experience with Master Magici
	an Curt Miller returns for 3 live\, family-friendly shows at South Shore H
	arbour Resort. \nThe intimate magical experience features amazing close-up
	 magic\, clean comedy\, audience interaction\, theatrical lighting\, music
	 and video in a vintage magic theater atmosphere— making it a great date n
	ight or friends night out. \nThe interactive show includes an incredible t
	rick you will perform yourself. \nAdmission\nTickets range from $50 to $90
	. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spo
	nsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and 
	more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, bus
	iness\, or offer across all of our channels\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.
	com/calendar/the-conjurer-an-intimate-magical-experience-with-master-magic
	ian-curt-miller-in-league-city-2026-1/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-conjurer-an-intimate-magica
	l-experience-with-master-magician-curt-miller-in-league-city-2026-1/
LOCATION:South Shore Harbour Resort & Conference Center\, 2500 South Shore 
	Blvd\, League City\, TX\, 77573\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Ricardo-Montaner-in-Concert-at-Smart-Finan
 cial-Centre.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/05/Ricardo-Montaner-in-Concert-at-Smart-Financial-Centre.jpeg
UID:VIyyH097O_bDL1hdCI9mH
SUMMARY:Ricardo Montaner in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DTSTAMP:20260811T095928Z
DTSTART:20260814T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Ricardo Montaner—the legendary 
	Latin pop singer-songwriter whose heartfelt ballads have captivated audien
	ces across generations—and his El Último Regreso Tour to the Sugar Land st
	age. \nKnown for his expressive tenor vocals and romantic songwriting\, Mo
	ntaner’s music blends Latin pop with emotional storytelling. His timeless 
	classics such as “La Cima del Cielo”\, “Me Va a Extrañar”\, and “Déjame Ll
	orar” continue to resonate with fans around the globe. \nAdmission\nTicket
	s start at $70. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar L
	isting was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar wi
	th images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, orga
	nization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365
	thingsinhouston.com/calendar/ricardo-montaner-in-concert-at-smart-financia
	l-centre/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/ricardo-montaner-in-concert-at-
	smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Suga
	r Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
